  MANIFEST                        │  providers/session.yaml                  no baseline — no Store
  ────────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
                                  │ kind: provider
                                  │ provider: session
                                  │ schema-version: 1
                                  │ class: local
  http                            │ capabilities: [http]
                                  │ operations:
  read  repeatable  secret token  │   read_session:
                                  │     kind: read
                                  │     deadline: 10s
                                  │     http:
                                  │       method: GET
                                  │       host: "{from-target}"
                                  │       path: /session
                                  │       host-input: host
                                  │     input:
                                  │       type: object
                                  │       properties:
                                  │         host: {type: string}
                                  │     record:
                                  │       identity: $.host
                                  │       fields:
                                  │         host: $.host
                                  │         token: $.body.token
                                  │         expires_at: $.body.expires_at
                                  │     secret: [token]

  FLAGS   index into the gutter above — no flag states anything the gutter does not
  SECRET  line 7  read_session declares secret output: token
